@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Future after MVP. Provider, advanced Sprint/review, or untrusted execution requirement retained as deferred.
title AFTER MVP — Proposed / conditional — Deployment strategy alternatives, not a selection
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

package "Rolling candidate" {
 rectangle "Compatible old / new instances" as R
 rectangle "Incremental replacement + verified admission" as RV
 R --> RV
}
package "Blue-green candidate" {
 rectangle "Existing active version" as B
 rectangle "Separate verified candidate" as G
 rectangle "Explicit guarded traffic switch" as S
 B --> S
 G --> S
}
package "Canary candidate" {
 rectangle "Existing version + bounded candidate cohort" as C
 rectangle "Observe agreed signals; explicitly expand / stop" as O
 C --> O
}
note bottom of S
 All alternatives require actual target/routing capacity, compatibility,
 approval and recovery evidence. No traffic percentage or duplicate host selected.
end note

@enduml
